              "reason": "Building the Windows page requires the MAUI Windows SDK pack for the .NET 11 release family.",
              "version": "11.0"
            }
          ],
          "providers": [
            "No external provider or account"
          ],
          "platforms": [
            "Windows x64; target binding20348, minimum OS17763; local host26200."
          ],
          "renderingModes": [
            "Native MAUI controls; no Blazor rendering mode"
          ],
          "prerequisites": [
            "GA composition: workload set 11.0.100.1 (Microsoft.NET.Workloads.11.0.100/11.100.1), Android 37.2.31, Apple 27.2.11039 and MAUI 11.0.0. Use JDK21 or25 and the selected Android SDK API37/build tools; Gradle9.1+ when invoked with JDK25. Apple requires Xcode27.2 on macOS Tahoe26.6+; the upstream Apple release says16.6+, conflicting with Apple host requirements. Binding SDK versions are not deployment floors. This source/artifact selection does not establish a locally installed native workload or native execution.",
            "Use a matching installed MAUI SDK pack; workload-list labels alone do not establish availability."
          ],
          "constraints": [
            "Current native sample is source-reviewed only under PIN-699. Incremental XAML Hot Reload remains a separate preview feature."
          ],
          "optIns": [
            "MauiXamlInflator=SourceGen"
          ],
          "stabilityLimitations": [
            "Actual GA generator source/artifact review; native generated output and execution not-tested.",
            "SourceGen only: XamlC/runtime inflation do not implement this path. Async lambdas remain unsupported; use normal event methods."
          ]
        },
